      "writtenOn": "2026-08-31T11:19:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this implementation assign an extra time budget to state sensor for its polling.\nIn the worst case, that state sensor spent all of its budget for its polling, numeric sensor has to wait 2x original time compared to its original time.\n\nHowever, in the most case it should be nearly zero because every polling shouldn\u0027t be spending so much budget.",
